OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fairly cloudy start with a
OL,6,Ffew showers at times. Turning
OL,7,Fincreasingly dry into the afternoon
OL,8,Fwith some warm sunny spells. Light
OL,9,Fwinds for most but breezy at the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers easing away this
OL,12,Fevening to leave a largely dry night
OL,13,Fwith clear spells. Turning chilly for
OL,14,Fmany with a few mist patches.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FA warm, dry and bright day
OL,17,Fwith plenty of sunny spells and light
OL,18,Fwinds. Clouding over in the evening
OL,19,Fperhaps with some outbreaks of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
